00:00:16.418 --> 00:00:19.727
And we are playing the Buzzfeed BFF test.

00:00:19.727 --> 00:00:22.810
(lighthearted music)

00:00:25.118 --> 00:00:27.052
- I'm not looking.

00:00:27.052 --> 00:00:27.885
I got my answer.

00:00:27.885 --> 00:00:30.968
(lighthearted music)

00:00:34.155 --> 00:00:36.018
Getting lipstick, I
was gonna say lipstick!

00:00:36.018 --> 00:00:37.433
I swear to God I was gonna say lipstick.

00:00:37.433 --> 00:00:38.994
- That was my other thing.

00:00:38.994 --> 00:00:41.550
(laughs)

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:44.633
(lighthearted music)

00:00:47.659 --> 00:00:50.992
- (laughs) Okay, ready?

00:00:53.444 --> 00:00:56.576
Yes, I didn't want to say that!

00:00:56.576 --> 00:00:58.097
But that's what I wrote!

00:00:58.097 --> 00:01:00.563
- (laughs) Imitate Gracie's mom.

00:01:00.563 --> 00:01:02.100
(gasps) We are best friends!

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:03.325
Oh, my God!

00:01:03.325 --> 00:01:04.762
This is so great (laughs).

00:01:04.762 --> 00:01:06.720
When he imitated Debbie Reynolds

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:09.930
in the scene and I farted, loud.

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:11.494
(laughs) I said it out loud.

00:01:11.494 --> 00:01:12.802
- Oh, you did.

00:01:12.802 --> 00:01:13.986
- I was like, "I just farted."

00:01:13.986 --> 00:01:15.462
- "I just farted," to the audience.

00:01:15.462 --> 00:01:16.605
(laughs)

00:01:16.605 --> 00:01:17.778
She is so proud of that.

00:01:17.778 --> 00:01:19.251
(laughs)

00:01:19.251 --> 00:01:21.834
(upbeat music)

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:25.221
- That was fast.

00:01:25.221 --> 00:01:27.304
(laughs)

00:01:33.572 --> 00:01:35.225
(groans)

00:01:35.225 --> 00:01:38.142
(imitating crying)

00:01:39.182 --> 00:01:40.936
- Oh, that was a good answer.

00:01:40.936 --> 00:01:42.249
Which is true, both people.

00:01:42.249 --> 00:01:43.536
- Both of you.

00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:46.119
(upbeat music)

00:01:49.587 --> 00:01:53.231
- I think I wrote what she
wrote, just more efficiently.

00:01:53.231 --> 00:01:56.564
Well, no, it could be totally different.

00:01:58.320 --> 00:01:59.211
- Yes!
- Yes!

00:01:59.211 --> 00:02:00.883
- Yes, oh, my God!

00:02:00.883 --> 00:02:01.881
- I wrote, "group prayer."

00:02:01.881 --> 00:02:04.088
- Prayer and I said,
"Hold hands in a circle

00:02:04.088 --> 00:02:05.716
"and say a mantra three times with cast."

00:02:05.716 --> 00:02:08.539
- Right, which is what Deborah
started from the pilot.

00:02:08.539 --> 00:02:09.857
- From the pilot.

00:02:09.857 --> 00:02:11.264
And for eight years,

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:13.870
every show.
- Every single show.

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:15.135
And it's good 'cause it bonds us.

00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:17.718
(upbeat music)

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:23.106
- I've gotta learn how
to be more efficient.

00:02:23.106 --> 00:02:24.588
(laughs)

00:02:24.588 --> 00:02:26.005
All right, ready.

00:02:28.706 --> 00:02:30.867
Coffee, oh, my God!

00:02:30.867 --> 00:02:32.275
Oh, my God!

00:02:32.275 --> 00:02:35.189
It's this just most brilliant scene

00:02:35.189 --> 00:02:38.261
where he comes in holding a cup of coffee

00:02:38.261 --> 00:02:40.067
and he does not stop talking,

00:02:40.067 --> 00:02:43.376
he comes in and he's like (squeals).

00:02:43.376 --> 00:02:46.661
And then, he kind of comes
back (laughs) into the van.

00:02:46.661 --> 00:02:49.422
And he ends up going
and he closes the door.

00:02:49.422 --> 00:02:52.836
- And they were so kind
because they knew how,

00:02:52.836 --> 00:02:53.669
can I swear?

00:02:53.669 --> 00:02:54.502
- [Crew Member] Yes.

00:02:54.502 --> 00:02:57.290
They knew how fucking
hard I was concentrating.

00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:59.525
I didn't stop talking
for like three pages.

00:02:59.525 --> 00:03:03.399
So, all they saw on my face
was me just saying words.

00:03:03.399 --> 00:03:05.876
But I liked it 'cause
it was a big challenge.

00:03:05.876 --> 00:03:07.181
- It was fantastic.

00:03:07.181 --> 00:03:10.431
(upbeat, guitar music)

00:03:13.937 --> 00:03:14.914
- Oh, juggling.

00:03:14.914 --> 00:03:16.589
- Oh, I was gonna put singing.

00:03:16.589 --> 00:03:17.846
I thought you would put singing.

00:03:17.846 --> 00:03:19.835
- Knitting and singing,
not at the same time.

00:03:19.835 --> 00:03:21.550
Not at the same time.

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:22.383
- But you know what?

00:03:22.383 --> 00:03:23.444
- [Sean] I remember you
used to always knit.

00:03:23.444 --> 00:03:26.911
- I went through a crazy
knitting phase on set.

00:03:26.911 --> 00:03:28.496
And it's very kind of you.

00:03:28.496 --> 00:03:29.490
- And she would come in and be like,

00:03:29.490 --> 00:03:31.451
"Look, I made this outfit,
look, I made this."

00:03:31.451 --> 00:03:33.437
And I'm like, "What?

00:03:33.437 --> 00:03:36.537
"That takes a company
like two years to make."

00:03:36.537 --> 00:03:38.903
- (laughs) But it's
very kind of you to say

00:03:38.903 --> 00:03:41.329
that it's a hidden talent of mine to sing.

00:03:41.329 --> 00:03:43.912
(upbeat music)

00:03:46.751 --> 00:03:48.251
There are so many.

00:03:51.551 --> 00:03:53.218
- I spelled Matthew.

00:03:54.771 --> 00:03:56.412
- [Crew Member] Wow.

00:03:56.412 --> 00:03:59.111
- Because Matt and I
used to play softball.

00:03:59.111 --> 00:04:01.783
- Do you realize how many episodes we had

00:04:01.783 --> 00:04:05.347
and how many people came
on our show in eight years?

00:04:05.347 --> 00:04:07.177
- Yes and we loved all of them.

00:04:07.177 --> 00:04:10.266
- Oh, my God, I can't believe we got it!

00:04:10.266 --> 00:04:11.367
- But the only thing is,

00:04:11.367 --> 00:04:15.154
is Matt and I used to
play softball, right?

00:04:15.154 --> 00:04:17.901
Like, on this little team in Santa Monica.

00:04:17.901 --> 00:04:19.894
And I just asked him one day,

00:04:19.894 --> 00:04:20.963
I'm like, "Hey, do you
want to do the show?"

00:04:20.963 --> 00:04:21.796
And he was like, "Okay."

00:04:21.796 --> 00:04:22.862
And that was it.

00:04:22.862 --> 00:04:24.500
And so, we did the show.

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:25.816
I didn't think you were gonna say that

00:04:25.816 --> 00:04:28.100
because he was more your storyline than--

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:29.389
Well, I guess he was both.
- No, he was the choir.

00:04:29.389 --> 00:04:30.539
- [Sean] Yeah, he was
both but he dated you.

00:04:30.539 --> 00:04:32.413
- He did, I tried to seduce him.

00:04:32.413 --> 00:04:34.996
(upbeat music)

00:04:37.406 --> 00:04:39.989
- We're not gonna get this one.

00:04:41.558 --> 00:04:42.641
- Sugar, yes!

00:04:44.088 --> 00:04:46.021
♫ That works

00:04:46.021 --> 00:04:48.023
♫ Mine was more specific

00:04:48.023 --> 00:04:49.734
- I know, I should've been.

00:04:49.734 --> 00:04:52.317
(upbeat music)

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:58.208
I'm gonna preface this by
saying, I am colorblind.

00:04:58.208 --> 00:05:00.291
(laughs)

00:05:07.869 --> 00:05:10.131
- Either green or brown.

00:05:10.131 --> 00:05:11.906
- What are they?

00:05:11.906 --> 00:05:13.098
- They're hazel, they're green.

00:05:13.098 --> 00:05:13.931
- Green.
- Yeah.

00:05:13.931 --> 00:05:14.905
- I have no idea.

00:05:14.905 --> 00:05:17.033
I literally honestly cannot
tell green, brown, red.

00:05:17.033 --> 00:05:19.488
- But I've got orange around the center.

00:05:19.488 --> 00:05:21.241
- Oh, she's a pumpkin,
she's got pumpkin eyes.

00:05:21.241 --> 00:05:24.530
- I know that Sean was my brother.

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:25.724
- Yeah, absolutely.

00:05:25.724 --> 00:05:27.292
- But through this game,

00:05:27.292 --> 00:05:31.577
I learned that he really
is my best friend.

00:05:31.577 --> 00:05:32.811
(laughs)

00:05:32.811 --> 00:05:35.569
- I learned that because
she just said that,

00:05:35.569 --> 00:05:37.279
I would probably sleep with her.

00:05:37.279 --> 00:05:38.112
(gasps)

00:05:38.112 --> 00:05:41.193
I also learned that
that's probably not true.

00:05:41.193 --> 00:05:43.721
But also, I would say I learned nothing

00:05:43.721 --> 00:05:46.975
because I already know
everything about her.

00:05:46.975 --> 00:05:48.571
(gentle music)

00:05:48.571 --> 00:05:50.866
- What do you mean you'd
sleep with me but not really?

00:05:50.866 --> 00:05:51.895
- I don't know what I was saying.

00:05:51.895 --> 00:05:53.036
(laughs)

00:05:53.036 --> 00:05:55.619
(upbeat music)

